&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingRevaluationOfLandForBusinessTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;※８．有形固定資産の減価償却累計額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
